# Nothing is built here. The @metalblas archive is pinned in workspace.bzl and
# patched via series.bzl; its five Metal shader headers are consumed by
# //xla/service/gpu/metal_kernels:metalblas_shaders, which xxd's them into
# get_<stem>() string accessors (NOT an -I include tree -- metalBLAS shaders
# have no cross-header includes). No build step ever rewrites them, which is
# what makes "verbatim" true by construction rather than true only if a
# generator is correct.
